# Build context exclusions for the Antithesis harness images
# (antithesis/docker/*.Dockerfile use the repository root as their build context).
#
# Without this, the context is roughly 2 GB and dominated by .git plus derived build output. The
# entries below are all either regenerated inside the image or irrelevant to it.
#
# build/ is excluded deliberately and not just for size: a stale apache-cassandra-<version>.jar from
# the developer's working tree makes bin/cassandra.in.sh abort with "JAR artifacts for multiple
# versions", and accumulated duplicate dependency versions in build/lib/jars break compilation. The
# image runs `ant realclean` as well, so this is belt and braces.

# NOTE: .build/ is deliberately NOT excluded — the image build invokes .build/sh/ai-build.
.git
.github
.circleci
.jenkins
.idea
build/
data/
logs/
profiler/
doc/build/

# local editor and OS noise
*.iml
.DS_Store

# never send credentials into a build context
**/*.key.json
**/*.pem
**/id_rsa*
